      "message": "The parameters to this don\u0027t vary, so I think you can use `IRQ_CONNECT`. It\u0027s not possible to test that it\u0027s connected that way, but that doesn\u0027t seem very useful anyway (you really need to test on hardware to verify the IRQ is set up correctly) and you can still use `irq_is_enabled(IT83XX_IRQ_CEC)` to check that the interrupt is enabled.",
