      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `irq_is_enabled(IT83XX_IRQ_CEC)` shows the interrupt is enabled after `task_enable_irq(IT83XX_IRQ_CEC)` but the `cec_interrupt` seems not triggered because I didn\u0027t get \"cec_interrupt\" in EC log after the command \"cec-ctl --playback\" on dirks. (no mater I used `IRQ_CONNECT` or `irq_connect_dynamic`)",
