      "side": 1,
      "message": "Although EC log doesn\u0027t show cec_interrupt triggered, CEC function looks fine.\n\"cec-ctl --to 0 --playback -S -d 0\" can show the system info for the CEC device and topology.\n\"cec-ctl --to 0 --standby\" the CEC device can be turned off.",
